20
00:01:45,969 --> 00:01:50,425
Provable, unlinkable, and on the employee's side of the table.

21
00:01:50,375 --> 00:01:54,346
The contract, the report and the tests are all public.

22
00:01:54,346 --> 00:01:55,909
Thank you.

